WEBVTT

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:03.427
Current pipelines run through ZTF one point x.

00:00:03.627 --> 00:00:07.936
Native pipeline opt-in, NKP and ZTF two point x console

00:00:07.936 --> 00:00:09.507
execution are retired.

00:00:09.728 --> 00:00:12.531
This replaces the former two point x preview lesson.

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:16.494
Retiring a launch path is different from deleting old jobs, configuration

00:00:16.758 --> 00:00:20.718
or recovery records. An existing Native pipeline can remain visible

00:00:20.811 --> 00:00:25.371
but blocked. An administrator must review every action and its YAML before

00:00:25.422 --> 00:00:27.078
explicitly converting it.

00:00:27.257 --> 00:00:31.579
Do not change an executor label and assume every old action is compatible.

00:00:31.822 --> 00:00:35.403
Keep the original definition and evidence available for comparison.

00:00:35.721 --> 00:00:40.372
Existing recovery runs retain the captured snapshot, approvals and completed

00:00:40.372 --> 00:00:44.481
work. Do not rewrite their history to match a newer profile.

00:00:44.681 --> 00:00:48.586
Continue through the supported run controls and its evidence requirements.

00:00:48.838 --> 00:00:53.459
The final step zero eight retry remains conditional on actual eligibility,

00:00:53.574 --> 00:00:55.713
reconciliation and fresh health.

00:00:56.049 --> 00:01:00.318
An older image can still contain NKP or two point x files.

00:01:00.592 --> 00:01:03.891
Their presence supports inspection and rollback compatibility;

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:07.027
it does not re-enable the retired console operations.

00:01:07.248 --> 00:01:11.429
Removing those dependencies or stored records is a separate reviewed phase.

00:01:11.751 --> 00:01:16.393
Compare the installed build with the current guide and package metadata before
relying

00:01:16.401 --> 00:01:20.702
on a feature. A source merge or a downloaded ZIP does not

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:25.071
update an appliance. Use the guided update process when needed, then

00:01:25.079 --> 00:01:29.333
verify supported workflows and retained state before operational use.
